text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Arcane Sanctum enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}, {U}, or {B}.', 'Artifact spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nDestroy target creature.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control a creature with power 5 or greater, you may draw a card.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control a creature with power 5 or greater, you may gain 2 life.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control a creature with power 5 or greater, you may have Exuberant Firestoker deal 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token with haste.\nGoblin creatures attack each combat if able.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, each player discards a card.', "Blightning deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards two cards.", 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Choose five permanents you control. For each of those permanents, you may search your library for a card with the same name as that permanent. Put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Choose one or both —\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature with flying.\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature without flying.', "Choose one —\n• Destroy target artifact.\n• Put target creature on the bottom of its owner's library.\n• Counter target instant spell.", 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target enchantment.\n• Draw two cards.\n• Target player discards two cards.', "Choose one —\n• Exile target player's graveyard.\n• Jund Charm deals 2 damage to each creature.\n• Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature.", "Choose one —\n• Naya Charm deals 3 damage to target creature.\n• Return target card from a graveyard to its owner's hand.\n• Tap all creatures target player controls.", "Choose one —\n• Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\n• Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\n• Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'Count the number of cards in your library. Your life total becomes that number.', 'Counter target spell that targets you or a permanent you control.\nDraw a card.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Counter target spell.', 'Counter target spell. Its controller loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', "Creatures you control gain shroud until end of turn. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'Crumbling Necropolis enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', 'Cycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Cycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy three target permanents.', 'Devour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nWhen Caldera Hellion enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to each creature.', 'Devour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nWhen Skullmulcher enters the battlefield, draw a card for each creature it devoured.', 'Devour 2 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with twice that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each +1/+1 counter on Mycoloth.', 'Devour 2 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with twice that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nWhen Tar Fiend enters the battlefield, target player discards a card for each creature it devoured.', 'Devour 2 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with twice that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\n{G}: Thorn-Thrash Viashino gains trample until end of turn.', 'Devour 3 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with three times that many +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Dragon creatures you control get +3/+3.', 'Each creature card in your graveyard has unearth {2}{B}. ({2}{B}: Return the card to the battlefield. The creature gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "Each player who has cast a nonartifact spell this turn can't cast additional nonartifact spells.", "Enchant artifact or creature\nEnchanted permanent doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has trample.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+0 and has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "Enchant creature\nWhen enchanted creature dies, that creature's controller loses life equal to its toughness.", 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land is a Mountain, Forest, and Plains.', 'Equipped creature has deathtouch.\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, that player loses half their life, rounded up.\nEquip {3}', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, you may tap target creature.', "Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{U}: Sighted-Caste Sorcerer gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{W}, {T}: Dawnray Archer deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Exile target attacking creature.\nCycling {5}{G}{W}{U} ({5}{G}{W}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Resounding Silence, exile up to two target attacking creatures.', 'Exile target card from a graveyard. You gain 3 life.', 'Exile the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. You may play lands and cast spells from one of those piles. If you cast a spell this way, you cast it without paying its mana cost.', 'Feral Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\n{3}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Feral Hydra. Any player may activate this ability.', 'First strike\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', "First strike\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'First strike\nUnearth {U}{B}{R} ({U}{B}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'First strike\nWhen Knight of the White Orchid enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'First strike\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Rockslide Elemental.', 'Flash\n{B}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your end step, you gain 3 life if Sphinx Sovereign is untapped. Otherwise, each opponent loses 3 life.', 'Flying\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains lifelink until end of turn.', 'Flying\nSacrifice Gustrider Exuberant: Creatures you control with power 5 or greater gain flying until end of turn.', "Flying\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to Empyrial Archangel instead.", 'Flying\nUnearth {2}{U} ({2}{U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\nWhen Broodmate Dragon enters the battlefield, create a 4/4 red Dragon creature token with flying.', 'Flying\nWhen Sanctum Gargoyle enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\nWhen Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying\nWhen Welkin Guide enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever Flameblast Dragon attacks, you may pay {X}{R}. If you do, Flameblast Dragon deals X damage to any target.', 'Flying\nWhenever Sedraxis Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\nWhenever an artifact creature you control deals combat damage to a player, you may create a 1/1 blue Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', 'Flying\nWhenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Glaze Fiend gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Scavenger Drake.', 'Flying\n{1}{W}: Cloudheath Drake gains vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Regenerate Skeletal Kathari.', 'Flying\n{R}, {T}: Vein Drinker deals damage equal to its power to target creature. That creature deals damage equal to its power to Vein Drinker.\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Vein Drinker this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Vein Drinker.', "Flying, haste\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Hell's Thunder.\nUnearth {4}{R} ({4}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", 'Flying, haste\nDevour 2 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with twice that many +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Flying, trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice a non-Zombie creature, then create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Flying, trample, haste\n{R}: Hellkite Overlord gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\n{B}{G}: Regenerate Hellkite Overlord.', "Flying, vigilance\nPlayers can't untap more than one creature during their untap steps.", 'Haste', 'Haste\n{T}: Target creature with power 5 or greater gains haste until end of turn.', "If a creature would enter the battlefield under an opponent's control this turn, it enters the battlefield under your control instead.", 'If you would lose the game, instead shuffle your hand, your graveyard, and all permanents you own into your library, then draw seven cards and your life total becomes 20.', 'Indestructible\n{1}: Target creature with power 5 or greater gains indestructible until end of turn.', "Jhessian Infiltrator can't be blocked.", 'Jungle Shrine enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.', 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\nWindwright Mage has flying as long as an artifact card is in your graveyard.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card and/or a land card from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Magma Spray deals 2 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Master of Etherium's power and toughness are each equal to the number of artifacts you control.\nOther artifact creatures you control get +1/+1.", "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)", "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", "Play with the top card of your library revealed.\nAs long as the top card of your library is an artifact or creature card, Skill Borrower has all activated abilities of that card. (If any of the abilities use that card's name, use this creature's name instead.)", "Players can't search libraries.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature, where X is that creature's power.", "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach\nIf a creature is attacking you and you control a Forest and a Plains, you may cast Qasali Ambusher without paying its mana cost and as though it had flash.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Resounding Thunder deals 3 damage to any target.\nCycling {5}{B}{R}{G} ({5}{B}{R}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Resounding Thunder, it deals 6 damage to any target.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Its controller draws a card.", "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\nCycling {5}{W}{U}{B} ({5}{W}{U}{B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Resounding Wave, return two target permanents to their owners' hands.", 'Reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. You lose life equal to its mana value. You may repeat this process any number of times.', "Reveal the top three cards of your library. Target opponent may choose to put those cards into your hand. If they don't, put those cards into your graveyard and draw five cards.", 'Sacrifice Bloodpyre Elemental: It deals 4 damage to target creature. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Savage Lands enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}, {R}, or {G}.', 'Seaside Citadel enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nWhenever another creature dies, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Algae Gharial.", 'Sigil of Distinction enters the battlefield with X charge counters on it.\nEquipped creature gets +1/+1 for each charge counter on Sigil of Distinction.\nEquip—Remove a charge counter from Sigil of Distinction.', 'Skeletonize deals 3 damage to target creature. When a creature dealt damage this way dies this turn, create a 1/1 black Skeleton creature token with "{B}: Regenerate this creature."', 'Skeletons you control and other Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have deathtouch.', "Steelclad Serpent can't attack unless you control another artifact.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Topan Ascetic gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\nCycling {5}{R}{G}{W} ({5}{R}{G}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Resounding Roar, target creature gets +6/+6 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\nTarget creature gets -0/-3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to any target.', 'Target opponent sacrifices a creature, discards three cards, then loses 5 life. You return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand, draw three cards, then gain 5 life.', 'Target player discards a card at random.\nCycling {5}{U}{B}{R} ({5}{U}{B}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\nWhen you cycle Resounding Scream, target player discards two cards at random.', 'Target player gains 7 life and draws two cards.', 'Trample', 'Trample\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Unearth {B} ({B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control get +5/+5 and gain first strike, trample, and lifelink.', 'Until end of turn, target creature you control gets +3/+3 and other creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Vigilance\n{T}: Add {G}.', "Vigilance\n{T}: Create an 8/8 Beast creature token that's red, green, and white.", 'Vigilance, haste', 'When Blister Beetle enters the battlefield, target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Carrion Thrash dies, you may pay {2}. If you do, return another target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Corpse Connoisseur enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card, put that card into your graveyard, then shuffle.\nUnearth {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', "When Kederekt Leviathan enters the battlefield, return all other nonland permanents to their owners' hands.\nUnearth {6}{U} ({6}{U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", 'When Knight-Captain of Eos enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.\n{W}, Sacrifice a Soldier: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ranger of Eos enters the battlefield, you may search your library for up to two creature cards with mana value 1 or less, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Realm Razer enters the battlefield, exile all lands.\nWhen Realm Razer leaves the battlefield, return the exiled cards to the battlefield tapped under their owners' control.", 'When Scourge Devil enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.\nUnearth {2}{R} ({2}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Sprouting Thrinax dies, create three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', "When Tidehollow Sculler enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals their hand and you choose a nonland card from it. Exile that card.\nWhen Tidehollow Sculler leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to its owner's hand.", "Whenever a creature dies, you may have Vicious Shadows deal damage to target player equal to the number of cards in that player's hand.", 'Whenever a creature with power 5 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may have Where Ancients Tread deal 5 damage to any target.', 'Whenever a creature with power 5 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may put two +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {2}. If you do, create a token that\'s a copy of that creature, except it has haste and "At the beginning of the end step, sacrifice this permanent."', 'Whenever a permanent an opponent controls is put into a graveyard, put that card onto the battlefield under your control unless that opponent pays 3 life.', 'Whenever a player taps a Mountain, Forest, or Plains for mana, that player adds one mana of any type that land produced.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, that player mills two cards.', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may have Hissing Iguanar deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Whenever another creature dies, you may put X +1/+1 counters on Kresh the Bloodbraided, where X is that creature's power.", "Whenever you cast a spell, Manaplasm gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is that spell's mana value.", 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each 1 life you gained.', 'Wild Nacatl gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Mountain.\nWild Nacatl gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Plains.', "You gain life equal to target creature's power.", "You may sacrifice three artifacts rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nExile thre