then shuffle.', '{2}{B}: Vectis Silencers gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy that creature.)', '{2}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a red creature, a green creature, and a white creature: Search your library for a card named Godsire, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a black creature, a red creature, and a green creature: Search your library for a card named Hellkite Overlord, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice a white creature, a blue creature, and a black creature: Search your library for a card named Sphinx Sovereign, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{2}{U}: Untap target artifact.', "{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Dispeller's Capsule: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.", '{2}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice a green creature, a white creature, and a blue creature: Search your library for a card named Empyrial Archangel, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{3}{G}: Knight of the Skyward Eye gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{3}{R}{G}{W}, {T}: Look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature card with power 5 or greater from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{4}{G}: Rockcaster Platoon deals 2 damage to each creature with flying and each player.', '{4}{W}, {T}, Sacrifice Protomatter Powder: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{B}, {T}: Target player loses 1 life.\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{G}, {T}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn.\n{U}, {T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', '{R}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\n{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{R}: Undead Leotau gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\nUnearth {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of 